{"page":71,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:158","surah":3,"ayah":158,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَئِن مُّتُّمْ أَوْ قُتِلْتُمْ لَإِلَى ٱللَّهِ تُحْشَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whether you die or are killed, it is to God that you will be gathered.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَئِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"3:158"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مُّتُّمْ","en_gloss":"you die","transliteration":"muttum","verse_key":"3:158"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"3:158"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قُتِلْتُمْ","en_gloss":"are killed","transliteration":"qutil'tum","verse_key":"3:158"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَإِلَى","en_gloss":"surely to","transliteration":"la-ilā","verse_key":"3:158"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:158"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تُحْشَرُونَ","en_gloss":"you will be gathered","transliteration":"tuḥ'sharūna","verse_key":"3:158"},{"pos":8,"ar":"١٥٨","en_gloss":"(158)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:158"}]},{"verse_key":"3:159","surah":3,"ayah":159,"ar_uthmani":"فَبِمَا رَحْمَةٍ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ لِنتَ لَهُمْ ۖ وَلَوْ كُنتَ فَظًّا غَلِيظَ ٱلْقَلْبِ لَٱنفَضُّوا۟ مِنْ حَوْلِكَ ۖ فَٱعْفُ عَنْهُمْ وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ لَهُمْ وَشَاوِرْهُمْ فِى ٱلْأَمْرِ ۖ فَإِذَا عَزَمْتَ فَتَوَكَّلْ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُتَوَكِّلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"By an act of mercy from God, you [Prophet] were gentle in your dealings with them- had you been harsh, or hard-hearted, they would have dispersed and left you- so pardon them and ask forgiveness for them. Consult with them about matters, then, when you have decided on a course of action, put your trust in God: God loves those who put their trust in Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَبِمَا","en_gloss":"So because","transliteration":"fabimā","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَحْمَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatin","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِنتَ","en_gloss":"you dealt gently","transliteration":"linta","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُنتَ","en_gloss":"you had been","transliteration":"kunta","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَظًّا","en_gloss":"rude","transliteration":"faẓẓan","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":10,"ar":"غَلِيظَ","en_gloss":"(and) harsh","transliteration":"ghalīẓa","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْقَلْبِ","en_gloss":"(at) [the] heart","transliteration":"l-qalbi","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَٱنفَضُّوا۟","en_gloss":"surely they (would have) dispersed","transliteration":"la-infaḍḍū","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":14,"ar":"حَوْلِكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"around you","transliteration":"ḥawlika","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَٱعْفُ","en_gloss":"Then pardon","transliteration":"fa-uʿ'fu","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"[from] them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"and ask forgiveness","transliteration":"wa-is'taghfir","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَشَاوِرْهُمْ","en_gloss":"and consult them","transliteration":"washāwir'hum","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the matter","transliteration":"l-amri","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":22,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":23,"ar":"عَزَمْتَ","en_gloss":"you have decided","transliteration":"ʿazamta","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":24,"ar":"فَتَوَكَّلْ","en_gloss":"then put trust","transliteration":"fatawakkal","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":25,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":26,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":27,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":28,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":29,"ar":"يُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"loves","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱلْمُتَوَكِّلِينَ","en_gloss":"the ones who put trust (in Him)","transliteration":"l-mutawakilīna","verse_key":"3:159"},{"pos":31,"ar":"١٥٩","en_gloss":"(159)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:159"}]},{"verse_key":"3:160","surah":3,"ayah":160,"ar_uthmani":"إِن يَنصُرْكُمُ ٱللَّهُ فَلَا غَالِبَ لَكُمْ ۖ وَإِن يَخْذُلْكُمْ فَمَن ذَا ٱلَّذِى يَنصُرُكُم مِّنۢ بَعْدِهِۦ ۗ وَعَلَى ٱللَّهِ فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If God helps you [believers], no one can overcome you; if He forsakes you, who else can help you? Believers should put their trust in God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَنصُرْكُمُ","en_gloss":"helps you","transliteration":"yanṣur'kumu","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":5,"ar":"غَالِبَ","en_gloss":"(can) overcome","transliteration":"ghāliba","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"[for] you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"and if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَخْذُلْكُمْ","en_gloss":"He forsakes you","transliteration":"yakhdhul'kum","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"then who","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذَا","en_gloss":"(is)","transliteration":"dhā","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the one who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَنصُرُكُم","en_gloss":"can help you","transliteration":"yanṣurukum","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَعْدِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"after Him","transliteration":"baʿdihi","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَعَلَى","en_gloss":"And on","transliteration":"waʿalā","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah ","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ","en_gloss":"let put (their) trust","transliteration":"falyatawakkali","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minūna","verse_key":"3:160"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٦٠","en_gloss":"(160)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:160"}]},{"verse_key":"3:161","surah":3,"ayah":161,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا كَانَ لِنَبِىٍّ أَن يَغُلَّ ۚ وَمَن يَغْلُلْ يَأْتِ بِمَا غَلَّ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ ثُمَّ تُوَفَّىٰ كُلُّ نَفْسٍ مَّا كَسَبَتْ وَهُمْ لَا يُظْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is inconceivable that a prophet would ever dishonestly take something from the battle gains. Anyone who does so will carry it with him on the Day of Resurrection, when each soul will be fully repaid for what it has done: no one will be wronged.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِنَبِىٍّ","en_gloss":"for a Prophet","transliteration":"linabiyyin","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَغُلَّ ۚ","en_gloss":"he defrauds","transliteration":"yaghulla","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَغْلُلْ","en_gloss":"defrauds","transliteration":"yaghlul","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَأْتِ","en_gloss":"will bring","transliteration":"yati","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":10,"ar":"غَلَّ","en_gloss":"he had defrauded","transliteration":"ghalla","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تُوَفَّىٰ","en_gloss":"is repaid in full","transliteration":"tuwaffā","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كُلُّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kullu","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":16,"ar":"نَفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":18,"ar":"كَسَبَتْ","en_gloss":"it earned","transliteration":"kasabat","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":20,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(will) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يُظْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"be wronged","transliteration":"yuẓ'lamūna","verse_key":"3:161"},{"pos":22,"ar":"١٦١","en_gloss":"(161)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:161"}]},{"verse_key":"3:162","surah":3,"ayah":162,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَمَنِ ٱتَّبَعَ رِضْوَٰنَ ٱللَّهِ كَمَنۢ بَآءَ بِسَخَطٍ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَمَأْوَىٰهُ جَهَنَّمُ ۚ وَبِئْسَ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Can the man who pursues God’s good pleasure be like the man who has brought God’s wrath upon himself and whose home will be Hell- a foul destination?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَفَمَنِ","en_gloss":"So is (the one) wh